  "definition": "Creative Tools are AI-powered software applications that assist or augment human creative processes across modalities including image generation, music composition, video synthesis, 3D asset creation, and long-form text authoring. They typically rely on foundation models\u2014particularly diffusion models and large language models\u2014exposed through interactive interfaces or API endpoints. Their role is dual: serving as productivity accelerators for professional practitioners and as accessibility bridges that allow non-expert users to produce high-quality creative outputs.",
